        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Aéroport Charles de Gaulle 2 TGV, Charles de Gaulle Airport, Paris, France, Belgium\n- Concepts: Airport rail connections, airport identity\n\nFacts:\n- Aéroport Charles de Gaulle 2 TGV connects Charles de Gaulle Airport to Paris, to various other cities in France, and to Belgium.\n- Charles de Gaulle Airport, also called Paris Charles de Gaulle Airport and Roissy Airport, is the largest international airport in France.\n- Charles de Gaulle Airport has the IATA code CDG and the ICAO code LFPG.",
